flowchart TD
    A[Client sends request] --> B[Exception Handler Middleware]
    B --> C[Status Code Pages Middleware]
    C --> D[Minimal API endpoint]

    D --> E{Expected validation failure?}
    E -- Yes --> F[Create 400 ProblemDetails]
    F --> G[Add errorCode and traceId]
    G --> H[Return response]

    E -- No --> I[Call application service]
    I --> J{Operation succeeds?}

    J -- Yes --> K[Return successful response]

    J -- No --> L[Service cleans partial resources]
    L --> M[Translate technical exception]
    M --> N[Throw application exception]

    N --> O[GlobalExceptionHandler]
    O --> P[Map exception to status and errorCode]
    P --> Q[Log full technical exception]
    Q --> R[Create safe ProblemDetails]
    R --> S[Add traceId]
    S --> H

    D --> T{No endpoint matches?}
    T -- Yes --> U[404 without response body]
    U --> V[Status Code Pages creates ProblemDetails]
    V --> W[Add resource_not_found and traceId]
    W --> H